Case Study Title:
                 Railway waiting list decision	
                
                 
USN:24BCAR0486, 24BCAR0535, 24BCAR0492

Name:Ranga Janith Ram, Yashwanth R, Sai Kishan

Algorithm:
1. start the program

2.Read total number of seats

3.Read number of seats already booked

4.Read number of tickts requested

5.Calculate available seats

6.If requested tickets ≤ available seats → Confirmed

    .Else if some seats are available → Witing List

    .Else → No Seats Available

7.Display the result

8.Stop the program

Code:

total_seats = int(input("Enter total number of seats: "))
booked_seats = int(input("Enter number of booked seats:"))
requested_tickets = int(input("Enter number of tickets requested:"))
     
     
available_seats = total_seats - booked_seats
     
     
if requested_tickets <=available_seats:
    print("Ticket Status:Confirmed")
elif avilable_seats > 0:
    print("Ticket Status: Waiting List")
else:
    print("Ticket Status : No Seats Avilable")
        

Output:
       Enter total number of seats:100
       Enter number of booked seats:98
       Enter number of tickets requested:3
       Ticket Status:Waiting List

